---
interface Props { lang?: 'de' | 'en'; }
const { lang = 'de' } = Astro.props;
const isEn = lang === 'en';
---
<section class="section roadmap-section" id="roadmap">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-label">{isEn ? 'Version 3.2' : 'Version 3.2'}</span>
      <h2>{isEn ? 'What the new version can do' : 'Was die neue Version kann'}</h2>
      <p>
        {isEn ? 'AUSTR.AI 3.2 introduces Skills (your own specialists), a local knowledge base for your own documents and an Austria-specific detection layer that catches addresses, ministries, universities and academic titles automatically — all without the data ever leaving your device.' : 'AUSTR.AI 3.2 bringt Skills (deine eigenen Profis), eine lokale Wissensbasis für deine Dokumente und einen Österreich-spezifischen Detection-Layer, der Adressen, Behörden, Hochschulen und akademische Titel automatisch erkennt — alles ohne dass die Daten dein Gerät verlassen.'}
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="roadmap-grid">
      <div class="roadmap-card roadmap-card-new">
        <div class="roadmap-badge">{isEn ? 'New' : 'Neu'}</div>
        <div class="roadmap-icon">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
            <path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/>
            <circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/>
            <path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/>
            <path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>{isEn ? 'Skills — your own specialists' : 'Skills — deine eigenen Profis'}</h3>
        <p>{isEn ? 'Define your own AI specialists — a legal advisor, a code reviewer, a writing coach. Each skill bundles a system prompt with a recommended model and runs through the same anonymisation pipeline as every other message. Activate via the chat header dropdown or with a slash command like /legal-skill.' : 'Lege deine eigenen KI-Profis an — einen Rechts-Berater, einen Code-Reviewer, einen Lektor. Jeder Skill verbindet einen System-Prompt mit einem empfohlenen Modell und läuft durch dieselbe Anonymisierungs-Pipeline wie jede andere Nachricht. Aktivierung über das Header-Dropdown im Chat oder mit einem Slash-Befehl wie /rechts-skill.'}</p>
      </div>

      <div class="roadmap-card roadmap-card-new">
        <div class="roadmap-badge">{isEn ? 'New' : 'Neu'}</div>
        <div class="roadmap-icon">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
            <path d="M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20"/>
            <path d="M6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>{isEn ? 'Local knowledge base' : 'Lokale Wissensbasis'}</h3>
        <p>{isEn ? 'Upload your own documents (PDF, Word, text) into a project. They are anonymised before indexing and stored locally — never in the cloud. While you type a question, AUSTR.AI shows in real time which snippets will be attached. The AI receives only the anonymised version; you see the readable original locally.' : 'Lade eigene Dokumente (PDF, Word, Text) in ein Projekt. Sie werden vor der Indexierung anonymisiert und lokal gespeichert — nie in der Cloud. Während du tippst, zeigt AUSTR.AI in Echtzeit, welche Stellen mitgesendet werden. Die KI bekommt nur die anonymisierte Version; du siehst lokal den lesbaren Originaltext.'}</p>
      </div>

      <div class="roadmap-card roadmap-card-new">
        <div class="roadmap-badge">{isEn ? 'New' : 'Neu'}</div>
        <div class="roadmap-icon">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
            <path d="M2 12h20"/>
            <path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>{isEn ? 'Austria-specific detection' : 'Österreich-spezifische Erkennung'}</h3>
        <p>{isEn ? 'Five new detection modules tailored for Austrian content: addresses (street + house number + 4-digit postal code + city), nine federal states and seventeen major cities, academic titles (Ing., Dr., Mag., Univ.-Prof., DDr., BA MA MSc), more than fifty universities and schools (FernFH, FH Technikum Wien, BORG, HTBLuVA, ...) plus sixty federal bodies (BMI, OGH, ÖGK, ÖBB, OeNB, Rotes Kreuz, ...). Catches what generic English-trained models miss.' : 'Fünf neue Detection-Module für österreichische Inhalte: Adressen (Straße + Hausnummer + 4-stellige PLZ + Ort), neun Bundesländer und siebzehn Großstädte, akademische Titel (Ing., Dr., Mag., Univ.-Prof., DDr., BA MA MSc), über fünfzig Hochschulen und Schulen (FernFH, FH Technikum Wien, BORG, HTBLuVA, ...) sowie sechzig Behörden (BMI, OGH, ÖGK, ÖBB, OeNB, Rotes Kreuz, ...). Fängt, was generische englischsprachige Modelle übersehen.'}</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Future vision -->
    <div class="roadmap-future">
      <span class="roadmap-future-label">{isEn ? 'In planning' : 'In Planung'}</span>
      <span class="roadmap-future-text">{isEn ? 'A browser extension that anonymises data directly inside ChatGPT, Claude and Gemini.' : 'Eine Browser-Erweiterung, die Daten direkt in ChatGPT, Claude und Gemini anonymisiert.'}</span>
      <span class="roadmap-future-divider">|</span>
      <span class="roadmap-future-text">{isEn ? 'A dedicated iOS app to use AUSTR.AI comfortably on your phone.' : 'Eine eigene iOS-App, um AUSTR.AI bequem am Handy zu nutzen.'}</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .roadmap-section {
    position: relative;
    background: var(--color-bg-alt);
  }

  .roadmap-section::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, var(--color-border), transparent);
  }

  .roadmap-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .roadmap-card {
    background: var(--color-bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 2rem;
    transition: all var(--transition-base);
    position: relative;
  }

  .roadmap-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-border-light);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  }

  .roadmap-card-experimental {
    border-color: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.3);
  }

  .roadmap-card-planned {
    border-color: rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.2);
  }

  .roadmap-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    padding: 2px 8px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .roadmap-card-new {
    border-color: rgba(13, 148, 136, 0.3);
  }

  .roadmap-card-new .roadmap-badge {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    background: rgba(13, 148, 136, 0.1);
  }

  .roadmap-card-new .roadmap-icon {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .roadmap-card-experimental .roadmap-badge {
    color: #F59E0B;
    background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.1);
  }

  .roadmap-card-planned .roadmap-badge {
    color: var(--color-accent-purple);
    background: rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.1);
  }

  .roadmap-icon {
    color: var(--color-text-dim);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .roadmap-card-experimental .roadmap-icon {
    color: #F59E0B;
  }

  .roadmap-card-planned .roadmap-icon {
    color: var(--color-accent-purple);
  }

  .roadmap-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .roadmap-card p {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .roadmap-future {
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.75rem; flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: 2rem; padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
    background: var(--color-bg-card);
    border: 1px dashed var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }
  .roadmap-future-label {
    font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-accent-purple);
    font-size: 0.75rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }
  .roadmap-future-divider { color: var(--color-border); }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .roadmap-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .roadmap-future { flex-direction: column; text-align: center; }
    .roadmap-future-divider { display: none; }
  }
</style>